WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.669
-Wow.
Family reunion is a hit!

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:05.304
We haven't had this many people
in the house in two years.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.340
-I know. But I'm honestly
a little worried

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.341
about all these people
using our bathroom.

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:10.610
Can the septic handle it?

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.646
-Don't worry.
We've got AeroToilet.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.980
-Aero what?

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.251
-From the makers of AeroBed,
now there's AeroToilet,

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.519
the inflatable guest toilet

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.855
you can really
go to the bathroom in.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.223
-Huh!

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:26.059
-In seconds, it's fully inflated
and ready to use.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:29.428
And voilà -- your home office
becomes our new guest bathroom.

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:31.864
-Wow!
That's amazing.

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:32.966
-Go ahead.
Give it a try.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.701
-Oh, boy!

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.503
Whoa! Whoa!

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:39.038
Is this supposed
to wobble like this?

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.373
-Just adjust the firmness
with that little toggle there.

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:44.644
-Oh.
[ Air hisses ]

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:45.812
-Better?
-Much.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.279
I mean,
I'm using this exactly the way

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:49.415
I'd use a regular
ceramic toilet.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.951
-That's the whole point.
-I mean, I can really do it all.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.186
-And more.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.620
And AeroToilet goes anywhere.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.388
And it's so affordable,
you'll want one

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:58.291
for every corner of your house.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.492
And since there's no plumbing,

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.194
there's no place
AeroToilet can't go.

00:01:02.194 --> 00:01:03.563
-Okay, that's awesome.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.698
-Not near an outlet?
Just inflate manually

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.968
using the convenient mouth tube.
[ Blowing ]

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.235
-Ooh, careful not to suck.

00:01:10.235 --> 00:01:12.472
-Good thinking.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.309
-Great party, Terry.
And I love the house.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:19.045
What is it, a three bedroom,
nine bath?

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:20.480
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:24.717
[ Zipper unzips, urinating ]

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:29.956
-There's even
inflatable toilet paper

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:32.591
and an inflatable magazine,
if you get bored.

00:01:32.591 --> 00:01:34.627
-Who is ready
for another hot dog?

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.664
-Right after this game.
[ Toilet squeaking ]

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.599
-Oh, yes!

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.667
-Oh, wow.

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.135
Looks like it's getting
pretty full.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:43.503
-Yeah.
-Now what?

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:44.871
-Well, when it's time
for the guests to leave,

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.639
all you do is open
this handy valve and --

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:49.175
-John! Not in here!
There's no plumbing!

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:51.677
-Oh, my God!
It's going everywhere!

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:53.879
-Everybody run!
-We're all gonna die!

00:01:53.879 --> 00:01:56.782
[ Screaming ]

00:01:57.783 --> 00:02:00.319
-AeroToilet,
from the makers of AeroBed.

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:02.021
Not safe for pool use.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.723
-Occupied.
[ Chuckles ]

